                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I only recommend this game if you realy like Flappy Bird.\n\nIt's an OKish game, considering $1 base price. But the regular mode is annoying, partly due to the semi-forced multiplayer feature. For each level, I have to click \"With Bot\" button, play a short level, click \"Next\" icon, and click \"Yes\" button every time.\n\nI only recommend this game if you really like Flappy Bird.",
